<title>POLAND: Polish WestLB unit guarantees ship deal.</title>
<headline>Polish WestLB unit guarantees ship deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westdeutsche Landesbank's Polish subsidiary guaranteed a $24.76 million contract for the conctruction of a container ship in the Szczecin shipyard, Westdeutsche Landesbank Polska SA said.</p>
<p>WestLB Polska said it had guaranteed an advance payment for the 1728 TEU vessel to be made for a German shipowner.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
